cff-version: 1.2.0

title: "plant: Parallel Annotation of Transcriptomes"

message: >
  PLANT is the core comparative transcriptomics platform.
  PLANT-RRain extends the PLANT ecosystem with 3D spatial
  annotation visualization. Please cite the associated
  paper and repository if you use this software.

type: software

authors:
  - family-names: Ali
    given-names: Asif

repository-code: "https://github.com/asifali-bio/plant"

abstract: >
  A de novo comparative transcriptomics framework for
  annotation-expression analysis across non-model organisms.

keywords:
  - transcriptomics
  - bioinformatics
  - RNA-seq
  - comparative genomics
  - protein domains
  - non-model organisms

license: MIT

version: "2.0.0"

date-released: 2026-04-30